{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:42:01Z","created_by_operation":"op_44f36ce79fc54898900a70d10df50054","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8b456beb70aa3563a60317763a6d14e17a3ce07e6d4f563d9a9cc13c82beb954","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"cloudflare/vibesdk@9da158d82c59 snapshot b32132cd1ca47fd1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_44d4adbfbb4e510d092072cd97334b92d765e404f0b4e85743c70c220edbf365","slc_a0fbf30fe8d83edea319ae09d3df7fbca884781a328bd978bf6377af7310a71e"],"source_ids":["src_01567cf0c04a5a4a84dff6cdb4d4505a"],"text":"Each generated application gets isolated SQLite-backed storage via a Durable Object Facet, with database inspection and reset controls available to users.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:42:01Z","updated_by_operation":"op_44f36ce79fc54898900a70d10df50054"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:42:01Z","created_by_operation":"op_44f36ce79fc54898900a70d10df50054","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8fad8a7021adb74686f4ba2e3e0dab0764eef50385d5bfc6b1d7b357cde8f28e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"cloudflare/vibesdk@9da158d82c59 snapshot b32132cd1ca47fd1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_678cda383419bd8a1c6e0c6d606e6687c46747e23a9828e6b2ccb6b4d0ead750"],"source_ids":["src_01567cf0c04a5a4a84dff6cdb4d4505a"],"text":"Feature settings are dashboard-managed rather than committed in wrangler.jsonc, with keep_vars: true preserving production values across deploys; listed toggles default to off while ENABLE_EMAIL_AUTH defaults to on.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:42:01Z","updated_by_operation":"op_44f36ce79fc54898900a70d10df50054"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:42:01Z","created_by_operation":"op_44f36ce79fc54898900a70d10df50054","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_94a04e26ea207c07d22ce0d485d65286df9d06156211a8a138edc085dbab4a46","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"cloudflare/vibesdk@9da158d82c59 snapshot b32132cd1ca47fd1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0be74d22e62db8c0e391f1cc2f610103e7819d48f575eccbf578b66d7ac52461"],"source_ids":["src_01567cf0c04a5a4a84dff6cdb4d4505a"],"text":"The architecture comprises a ThinkAgent Durable Object running the model-and-tool loop, a SpaceDO workspace per project, Cloudflare Artifacts for git history and restore points, a Worker Loader for Dynamic Worker previews, and a generated App Durable Object Facet with SQLite.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:42:01Z","updated_by_operation":"op_44f36ce79fc54898900a70d10df50054"}
